{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_03",
  "title": "光与影",
  "storyCode": "IW-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f2b6836e2b2230def0d2b88f5eb963df42b8000afc087a7512ec416468e0b456",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g09_teahouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "晌午，晴，仿佛前一日的风雨欲来只是个不痛不痒的玩笑。\n尚蜀三山十七峰，第二高山，是居奇山。而居奇山只有二峰，其中第二高的峰，即是泥泥峰。\n泥泥峰又有二千二百二十二级台阶，本来没这么凑巧，是为了取个噱头，后来特地加算进去的。\n台阶向天，穿云踱雾。愈往高处，游客越少，人踪渐薄，徒留青山。\n而零星可见的身影，一眼望去，皆是挑夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆歇脚人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然比不得天岳，可当真是一座高峰啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆歇脚人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说这些修不得公路的半山腰上，是怎么建起一家家茶馆凉亭的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆观光客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨，能怎么的，靠人力呗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆观光客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们上来的时候，不是看见一个挑夫走下山去嘛？他们每天就这一趟趟的，小到干粮茶水，大到石砖青瓦，不都是挑上来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆观光客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说他们一趟路要爬个好些时辰，辛苦得很。就算到了今天，有些偏僻山头啊，还是离不开挑夫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆歇脚人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就不能拉个索道，或者起个吊车之类的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆观光客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也得先有个施工的地儿吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆歇脚人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也对，不过我也不太明白这是怎么整的......不过他们还真了不起啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆歇脚人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们应该赚挺多吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆观光客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前不多，不过前段时间看新闻说，尚蜀知府非常重视这些卖力气的，甚至这些茶馆的茶水都是政府掏钱免费提供的......呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，让让。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晌午茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞，尚师傅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近怎么样？有几天没见着你了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不怎么样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做什么去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看望我儿子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......又到了这个时候啦......我都忙忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚师傅早点打声招呼，我们可以陪着去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他喜欢清静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，都过去好多年啦......我是和你熟悉，才和你说这些话，你别介意啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人总是要向前看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在替郑清钺说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "废话，我们这家店都是郑掌柜投资的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿人钱，替人说话，那我就不怨你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也有一半是真心话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那我怨你一半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么多年了，多劝你一句不多，少劝你一句不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好喝茶，好好想想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆歇脚人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们刚才在山路上，是不是看见过那人下山？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆观光客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是啊？这才多久？爬回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆观光客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该是路上遇到同事，接了个力吧......不然这才半个时辰，就从半山腰到这儿走了个来回？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不行，联系不上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通讯没有反应，就说明年和夕还不在尚蜀地界......也可能他们根本没有按照行动守则行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恩人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我知道你要说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我不是什么过目不忘的聪明人，可我要是没看错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鲤先生交给梁先生的那只匣子，和那位年小姐当时手里的东西，是一个图样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然和她们俩的突然离队有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，咱们怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......其实我也不是没有预料到这个情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和小炎熔说好啦，等她到了办事处，立刻联络尚蜀附近的干员来接我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？原来恩人早有准备？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就猜到年一路上鬼鬼祟祟的，准没好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那意思是，我们果然还是先留在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然这么巧遇上了鲤先生，自然是要帮忙的。合同上是这么写的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此，恩人秉公办事，兢兢业业，令人钦佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可毕竟鲤先生是个聪明人。客栈偶遇之后，他一直没开口请求罗德岛的协助，也许本来就是在暗示我们不必掺和此事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果事情真的和年有关......再加上那个太合和左乐说的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，到时先去约定好的地点瞧瞧。虽然我想年多半不会守约，但夕不是那样的人。说不定能见她一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说的是，夕小姐应该会透露一些线索吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎么想，有些事情也实在是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——实在是太巧了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小乌有，你选那家客栈落脚，总不能是别有用心吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人说笑了，就算我别有用心，我也没能耐指使钳兽掀了我的车，再恰巧撞上恩人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那究竟是谁，能让这件事巧得不能再巧了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恩人，您刚才应该是开玩笑的吧，是开玩笑的吧？不是真怀疑我吧？恩人！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这件事不是应该全部交给我负责吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总得有人收拾烂摊子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爹能做到的，我分明也能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就算能，也不能。只要你还是杜遥夜，不是杜镖头，就绝对不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爹为什么在客栈时没有瓮中捉鳖，还特地制止你？你难道猜不到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那个身手了得的卡特斯，和那个叫乌有的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那看来你还没到火候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什么火候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "识人的火候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您究竟是想让我继承您的位置，还是想让我一辈子当那个不谙世事的杜大小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......镖师多结仇。你不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我要当那个纨绔可笑、不明事理的大小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要让所有人相信，那个郑大镖头已经是个踏踏实实做生意的老头子，而我，不过是扶不上墙的继承人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可那终归不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......夜儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您知道现在镖局年轻人对您有多大意见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们懂什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您又懂什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火急火燎想当甩手掌柜，却看不到多少年轻一辈早就对镖局现状怨声载道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那你凭良心告诉爹，和那群不成器的徒弟一起自立门户，就是你真正想做的事情了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在这个你，就是你了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只知道，这件事，爹是让我办的。办成了，就能服众，还能做成一件大事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怕你做不好这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更怕你存心做不好这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不懂爹在说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果爹您改了主意，请赶紧告诉我，如果没有，那么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就请您别管我的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g02_yanalley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......杜小姐，情况怎么样？掌柜的怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，能怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "郑老头让人给耍了，那伙人早早做好了调包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看用不着咱们故意把事儿弄砸，掌柜的自己就能玩脱咯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我看未必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他意识到我们的想法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊、啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他知道了？那怎么办？师傅们要是罚我们禁足，不就什么都做不了了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......要迅速解决问题，很麻烦。可要是迅速制造问题，总是不难的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早年游览尚蜀就感叹过一番，尚蜀百姓实在是有本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从新峦区到流云区，需要绕过多少座奇峰险峻？城区分散在山峦之中，烟火更是遍布山间，奇景奇景，妙哉妙哉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先前抢你物件的那件事，你弄明白了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是我相信梁洵，所以信得过慎师傅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你算活成人精了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁洵是这么说我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我自个儿以为的。咋会想到梁大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他以前说过我，说我装模作样，算天天不准，测地地不灵，唯独谁都说叵测的人心，我每一次都能蒙得准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就叫活成人精了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......经验罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接着走吧。这座昏谭峰就这么点大，一路走来，确实没见着过什么亭子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "取江峰不远，可为什么要选那座山头？要找人，直接去人家最多的地方不好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "取江峰以前叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攥江峰。名字难写难记，后来要开发成景区，就改名了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我做了一个怪梦，梦里，我在那山峰顶上寻人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还有这种神奇的事儿？是鲤小子你以前来尚蜀的时候听说过这个古名？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许吧......或者说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......指不定是有仙人指路呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你会用法术吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在是叫源石技艺了？文绉绉的名字，这类东西，搁在很久以前，不就和神仙鬼怪差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就不对咯，慎师傅。符箓为人驱使，乃人定胜天之道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人定胜天之道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我喜欢这句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，源石技艺，源石技艺，真是不太懂现在这些源石研究的门道......嗯？干嘛愣在原地？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才......我说了什么吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人定胜天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没什么，当我发白日梦了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......取江峰，攥江峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们分明几次探寻，可还是毫无线索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......理所当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "司岁台还是下定了决心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可她......在尚蜀的她，真在历史上有过什么大是大非吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她当年又为何愿意为大炎出力，参军戍边数十载？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "岁月悠悠，绝非常理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可眼下之事似乎事与愿违，梁先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果她是影子，那从龙门带来的酒盏，就是火光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......先有光还是先有影，真是个无意义的难题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难在解题人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "司岁台亲自找我，晓之以理动之以情，我当然明白轻重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你本答应左将军，酒盏抵达尚蜀后，便佯装遭劫，送与左公子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以此瞒过某些人的眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我总不能一五一十地告诉老鲤他一个外人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就不该选那个龙门人来替你做这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是碍于身份，不可贸然行事，万一影响尚蜀的早春烟火，得不偿失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然我在尚蜀为官，一砖一瓦，都是大事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可那个龙门人不是你的朋友吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我的朋友。但也是外人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......人多眼杂，不怨梁先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒盏如今？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既要托我那友人，酒盏自然在他的身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人打算假手于人，让那龙门人找出令之所在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "传言那盏能附灵于周遭器物，当真无事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......太合先生，我也有一事相问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我放下官阶立场，平心而论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这次司岁台可是绕过礼部，激进行事，大有越俎代庖之嫌。事后礼部反应过来，免不了一番唇枪舌剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你既是肃政院副监察御史，对此作何想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将军于我有恩，太合知恩图报而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就是私情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不错，私情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肃政院监察御史，体察百官，肃整朝仪，似乎与私情这个词，相去甚远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那若是肃政院得知此事详情后，觉得礼部才合情理，司岁台大错特错，私情又怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "取忠舍义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......太合先生回答得很果断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教我这四个字的，正是将军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大丈夫，当如是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过梁先生大可不必担忧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左将军既然是大炎军人，绝不会擅行有违律法之事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是有人让司岁台如此作为？哪怕越过礼部那些人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也对......谁能让平祟侯左宣辽不去劳心边疆事务，特地来操劳这区区一件酒盏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说小不小，说大不大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于是谁，心知肚明便是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁先生保重身体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......今年尚蜀的早春，还是比预想的冷些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g05_mountaincity_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "取江峰周边，除了一些散户，就这一个镇子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这儿是个怎么样的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早在尚蜀城市尚未建立的时候，这里临近边疆，山脉矿藏丰富，有许多铁匠和雕石匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......世道太平，移动城市也开进了群山之中，除了被当作景点保留下来的些个大锻炉，剩下的都成了民宿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎师傅，那这取江峰上......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这就没印象了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......也许只是个观棋饮酒的去处？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟若是什么名胜之地，那也轮不到我来找了，多半还得是那种地处偏僻、无人问津的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......尚蜀山水我也算熟稔得很了，还从未听说过取江峰有什么无人问津的亭子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "取江峰的山顶，只有偌大一片空地。传说有神人在此悟得临渊忘水之道，所以人称“忘水坪”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那这找人的活儿，可难办多了......不如从酒铺下手？可梁洵又说不知道那人模样，问了也白问......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎师傅，有何高见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找人嘛，自古以来都只有一个方法最简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是让那个人来找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有道理，可惜这道理有些缺乏能动性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我倒是有个想法——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......宁小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人有雅兴，这会还看闲书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闲书总是多多益善的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宁小姐有话便说就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人最近，是不是遇上了什么麻烦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......宁小姐是指？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的那位龙门朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是有些麻烦事，瞒不过宁小姐的眼，私事罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于什么的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......找什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一位我与他的故友，是个武林中人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只是个武林中人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姓槐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这件小事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一早就说了，是一件......小事，不劳宁小姐费心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人可不该瞒我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有什么好瞒你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前的女子在房间踱步，扫视书架，仿佛有一种失落的情绪笼罩四周。\n所幸很快，她又提起了兴致。\n她的情绪总是这般变化很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......梁大人手里那本闲书，是本历史传记？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......说的是过去在这尚蜀三山地界，发生的一场天灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人很喜欢那段历史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亲眼所见，终生难忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得是叫......《三山谈》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宁小姐倒是记得清楚，看来我翻这些书，次数有些多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......偶然留意而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有空把它借我一阅吧，我好在一会拜访白叔叔的时候，打发打发时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来取吧，因为近日看得少，放在高处了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宁小姐一会就要去白陶工那儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还请宁小姐替我向他问好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我先去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g10_lianghouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......《三山谈》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人也不会想到，其实那次你熬夜伏案，睡着在书房，我已经偷偷翻过这些闲书打发时间了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这本书......本来不放在那上面的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那么原本书架上多出的那只盒子......装的又是什么呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
